{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-66","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与二项无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"A straight line commensurable in length with a binomial straight line is itself also binomial and the same in order.","book":10,"number":66,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.66","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.66/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":66,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","contentId":"euclid-10-66","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"97c513b845e89c6b1e5283bed7e578a7c27aeb257353cd246ccaf7956c3d36e4","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-66.statement","euclid-10-66.construction.1","euclid-10-66.proof.1","euclid-10-66.construction.2","euclid-10-66.proof.2","euclid-10-66.proof.3","euclid-10-66.proof.4","euclid-10-66.proof.5","euclid-10-66.proof.6","euclid-10-66.proof.7","euclid-10-66.proof.8","euclid-10-66.proof.9","euclid-10-66.proof.10","euclid-10-66.proof.11","euclid-10-66.proof.12","euclid-10-66.proof.13","euclid-10-66.proof.14","euclid-10-66.proof.15","euclid-10-66.proof.16","euclid-10-66.proof.17","euclid-10-66.conclusion","euclid-10-66.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-66.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67242a200c99dbf25f704afbdf15fb68ea052a62013d8c0325e8274e5f108a0a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A straight line commensurable in length with a binomial straight line is itself also binomial and the same in order."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"长度可公度线二项无理线段线,本身也是二项无理线段线,顺序相同。（相关点与线段：A）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"46db6bbba01852d253bc297dcafc2f23dc8c665c422fdc5cae6a7a7b47054f08","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be binomial, and let CD be commensurable in length with AB; I say that CD is binomial and the same in order with AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为二项无理线段,让CD成为长度可公度,AB成为AB;我说,CD就是二项无理线段,AB也是这样。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b89124ab0fc421d0653f7620895884d36546e1d7d02b5244b90217b8daf93e91","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is binomial, let it be divided into its terms at E, and let AE be the greater term; therefore AE, EB are rational straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AB是二项无理线段,所以按E分为AE,而AE是较大的数目;因此,AE,EB是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c8fc8a856e5dc893fd07c3af7c09d82a74ccbd902b4485bb6f3e2cacc5b85e0","citations":["euclid-6-12","euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that, as AB is to CD, so is AE to CF; [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)] therefore also the remainder EB is to the remainder FD as AB is to CD. [[V. 19](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不妨假设,AB对CD的比等于AE对CF的比;因此,其余的EB与其余的FD的比是AB对CD；AB 与 CD 之比等于 AE 与 CF 之比。 [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)] [[V. 19](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"acd7f6f2d5ebefb97531199fdd8f1e8aaaecaa0f9432e30b40abcf7a6db584fa","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB is commensurable in length with CD; therefore AE is also commensurable with CF, and EB with FD. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB为长度可公度,CD;因此,AE也是可公度,CF,EB,FD。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad66d3d9d6cedc2a8c3c0f29c039a9436c1213fac8bdcc6f657035f0ac6425aa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AE, EB are rational; therefore CF, FD are also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE,EB是有理,CF,FD也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"848f5ef2c5ad067896f60d96ae0d793eea118e687521904c38c98b94999c77c2","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as AE is to CF, so is EB to FD. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE比CF等于EB比FD；AE 与 CF 之比等于 EB 与 FD 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d7cea02dfcebaa27494742f2d6f3ec63706fc418664900aca9f144a46d19f44","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, alternately, as AE is to EB, so is CF to FD. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE比EB的比例与CF比FD之比；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5553c07f18b7966e9c2e19cbecc4d67ee2f047d0a6c9cbe2921be7303d27120e","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AE, EB are commensurable in square only; therefore CF, FD are also commensurable in square only. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AE,EB是平方可公度而长度不可公度,因此CF,FD也是平方可公度而长度不可公度。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c060a2938f325995cd1323707fb572ba58eea44eed2186549fc4d1311a627f6","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are rational; therefore CD is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们是有理,CD是二项无理线段。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87dac7dfc8d32008e4dc9fb3c44be8fb1a9ccb485f754e3ff91b6f8610ff2e3b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is the same in order with AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,这与AB的顺序相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7d3f82e2d5094c6c36ab1f51220375a244df5241c0164bf2495fd5a7c61d310","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the square on AE is greater than the square on EB either by the square on a straight line commensurable with AE or by the square on a straight line incommensurable with it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE线上的正方形比EB线上的正方形要高,或者比可公度上的正方形比AE线上不可公度上正方形要高,或者比不可公度上正方形比正方形还高。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12d52d226b98c2133ed8def1f72cd2ba5ddb68f1171b99f767ebb1883c65bc4d","citations":["euclid-10-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If then the square on AE is greater than the square on EB by the square on a straight line commensurable with AE, the square on CF will also be greater than the square on FD by the square on a straight line commensurable with CF. [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果AE上的正方形比EB的正方形长,再乘可公度直线上正方形直线上AE直线上可公度,则CF直线上正方形则也比FD直线上正方形正方形高,再乘可公度直线上CF直线上可公度正方形直线上CF。 [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c7d032cc5ebbe5507514ee8ae3d453712ca816ee9e1eca244745479bbb56b46","citations":["euclid-10-12","euclid-10-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if AE is commensurable with the rational straight line set out, CF will also be commensurable with it, [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] and for this reason each of the straight lines AB, CD is a first binomial, that is, the same in order. [[X. Deff. II. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果AE是可公度,有理线段是设定的,CF也是可公度,因此,AB直线中的每一条线都是第二项无理线段,顺序相同。（相关点与线段：CD） [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] [[X. Deff. II. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf9c0444828389298a116b04c8dc0c4cf0103cc9b02476115a356b9c4d4c512d","citations":["euclid-10-12","euclid-10-def-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if EB is commensurable with the rational straight line set out, FD is also commensurable with it, [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] and for this reason again CD will be the same in order with AB, for each of them will be a second binomial. [[X. Deff. II. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果EB是可公度,有理线段是设定的,FD也是可公度,因此,CD将是AB,因为每一个将是第二个二项无理线段。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] [[X. Deff. II. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8438d3eafb75beed10202520965650e1c1c4e0e6ded5b7283e5ef25530a7af4c","citations":["euclid-10-13","euclid-10-def-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if neither of the straight lines AE, EB is commensurable with the rational straight line set out, neither of the straight lines CF, FD will be commensurable with it, [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] and each of the straight lines AB, CD is a third binomial. [[X. Deff. II. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果AE线中没有一个是可公度线,有理线段线是可公度线,CF线FD线中没有一个是可公度线,AB线中每一个是二项无理线段线,AB线中每一个是第三个二项无理线段线。（相关点与线段：EB、CD） [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] [[X. Deff. II. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5abfc042985024ca57d3167c5af75f9452a492657031ac510621fa69862a85e3","citations":["euclid-10-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if the square on AE is greater than the square on EB by the square on a straight line incommensurable with AE, the square on CF is also greater than the square on FD by the square on a straight line incommensurable with CF. [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果AE的正方形比EB的正方形高,不可公度比AE线比正方形比AE线比正方形,CF线比FD线比正方形比不可公度比CF线比正方形比正方形比号线比正方形比不可公度比CF线比正方形比正方形比正方形比正方形比正方形比正方形比正方形比CF线。 [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8a3503fffd9972d14e481a9d99633e8abf9d7ed303db0f1aadf687151284da8","citations":["euclid-10-def-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if AE is commensurable with the rational straight line set out, CF is also commensurable with it, and each of the straight lines AB, CD is a fourth binomial. [[X. Deff. II. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果AE是可公度,有理线段是设定,CF也是可公度, 每一个直线AB,CD是第四二项无理线段。 [[X. Deff. II. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b577fcf01a1299dc223d6fa4959c981090edbe55c76f533cf458d166c37c97f","citations":["euclid-10-def-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if EB is so commensurable, so is FD also, and each of the straight lines AB, CD will be a fifth binomial. [[X. Deff. II. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果EB是可公度,FD也是, 每一个直线AB,CD将是第五个二项无理线段。 [[X. Deff. II. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"613d1e318a3e985b3434f9a4beb25149a1a603db557e9418380acdba8adeecc3","citations":["euclid-10-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if neither of the straight lines AE, EB is so commensurable, neither of the straight lines CF, FD is commensurable with the rational straight line set out, and each of the straight lines AB, CD will be a sixth binomial. [[X. Deff. II. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果AE线和EB线都不是那么可公度线,那么CF线和FD线都不是可公度线,有理线段线和AE线都已经划定,AB、CD线中的每一个线将是第六条二项无理线段。 [[X. Deff. II. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":20,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d91f0167d11d8e064beb230287b8e8c5830a86cd0ee10cead2217a31693c4421","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence a straight line commensurable in length with a binomial straight line is binomial and the same in order. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,长度可公度线二项无理线段线直线为二项无理线段线,顺序相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-66.source","contentId":"euclid-10-66","revisionId":"euclid-10-66@raw-97c513b845e89c6b","order":21,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab54025f9d47b162f8c24ae59ca20142e6b77058e1fc81801351776b6b52019c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.66/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:t